269
00:18:25,420 --> 00:20:59,590
The square-shaped furnace Greed pulled out is the exact same furnace we saw Tu Si craft when Wang Lin obtains the Ancient God memory inheritance in episode 36 which is why he instantly recognizes it.


“Greed… Greed… This person really is full of treasures, even his second Origin Soul is a dragon! The furnace that Tu Si refined back then also landed in his hands… His cultivation level is also high, so he can be considered someone who has the heavens’ own luck!”

Wang Lin bitterly smiled. He didn’t know that back when Greed was only eight and hadn’t even started cultivating, he found a five-hundred-year-old Soloman’s Seal (plant) while playing. He took it home and ate it after breaking it. Not only was he not killed by the surge of energy inside it, but it laid his foundation as a cultivator.


Fun Fact if you read I Shall Seal the Heavens (Renegade Immortal's sequel), Meng Hao uses a very very similar artifact. Lore-wise they are not the same item, but their similarity makes me think Meng Hao's Lightning Cauldron was inspired by Ancient God Tu Si's furnace.

